description:
Hand off a multi-step, multi-day task that golive runs to completion, even after this session ends. Paid or irreversible steps pause for the user's approval through a link. Job types:
- launch_domain: Buy a domain, put its DNS on the configured provider, point it at your app, and confirm it resolves and serves HTTPS. Pauses for the user to approve the purchase with their passkey. Can take minutes to hours; the job keeps running after this session ends.
launch_domain input: { "domain": "example.com", "target": "my-app.vercel.app or an IPv4 address" }
